<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>نجلاء السبيعي | Najla Alsubaie</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Tajawal:wght@400;500;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-dark: #0f071a;
      --bg-card: #1a0d2e;
      --purple-primary: #8b5cf6;
      --purple-glow: #6d28d9;
      --purple-soft: #c4b5fd;
      --text-main: #f5f3ff;
      --text-muted: #c4b5fd;
      --border-color: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.28);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Tajawal', sans-serif;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, #241042 0%, var(--bg-dark) 55%);
      color: var(--text-main);
      line-height: 1.7;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 960px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }

    header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 50px 24px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(46, 16, 101, 0.75), rgba(20, 10, 38, 0.9));
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    h2.hero-name {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffffff, #c4b5fd);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .hero-role {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #e9d5ff;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 0 auto 24px;
    }

    .social-links {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 14px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn {
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 11px 24px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--purple-primary), var(--purple-glow));
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(109, 40, 217, 0.45);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.65);
    }

    .btn-outline {
      background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.12);
      color: var(--text-main);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    }

    .btn-outline:hover {
      background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25);
    }

    section {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    h2.section-title {
      font-size: 1.45rem;
      color: #e9d5ff;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      border-right: 4px solid var(--purple-primary);
      padding-right: 12px;
    }

    .skills-grid {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .skill-tag {
      background: rgba(109, 40, 217, 0.22);
      border: 1px solid rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.35);
      color: #ede9fe;
      padding: 8px 18px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .project-card {
      background: rgba(15, 7, 26, 0.65);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 22px;
      margin-top: 15px;
    }

    .project-card h3 {
      color: #ddd6fe;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .project-card p {
      color: #c4b5fd;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .video-wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 14px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      background: #090410;
    }

    video {
      width: 100%;
      display: block;
      max-height: 460px;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      color: #a78bfa;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      padding-top: 10px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <h2 class="hero-name">Najla Alsubaie | نجلاء السبيعي</h2>
      <p class="hero-role">Software Developer • Computer Science Graduate</p>
      <div class="skills-grid" style="justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 16px;">
        <span class="skill-tag">Dart</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Java</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Android</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">iOS</span>
      </div>
      <p class="subtitle">
        شغوفة ببناء تطبيقات مبتكرة، وتقديم تجارب مستخدم سلسة مدعومة بالتقنية الحديثة.
      </p>
      <div class="social-links">
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/najla-alsubaie-1797363b6" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary">LinkedIn</a>
        <a href="mailto:najlaalsubaie25@gmail.com" class="btn btn-outline">Email</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/inajla2000" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline">GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2 class="section-title">اللغات والتقنيات والمهارات</h2>
      <div class="skills-grid">
        <span class="skill-tag">Dart</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Java</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Android</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">iOS</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Web Development</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Microsoft Office</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">الابتكار</span>
        
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="section-title">أعمالي   </h2>
      <div class="project-card">
        <h3>مشروع الويب (Web Project)</h3>
        <p>استعراض عملي لواجهة المشروع وطريقة عمله.</p>
        <div class="video-wrapper">
          <video controls src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e7b5f97f-cd3b-4a4b-9800-10d3fca1859a"></video>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
      © 2026 نجلاء السبيعي — جميع الحقوق محفوظة
    </footer>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
